{"id":"vod_hh_27914","vodId":"27914","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"斩·赤红之瞳","name_cn":"斩·赤红之瞳","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第24集","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/31aa9651503a33c7f28f2a6e4d46b6e0.jpg"},"summary":"历经了千年的繁华，巍峨帝都早已从内部腐烂，拥有邪魔灵魂的统治者，正引领文明走向毁灭。为了解除村庄的困境，拥有绝赞剑术的少年塔兹米（齐藤壮马 配音）独闯帝都。此时帝都至高无上的皇帝还只是不谙世事的孩子，国家的实际操纵者大臣只手遮天，是帝都腐朽的根源。历经一波三折，塔兹米被曾经骗过自己的雷欧奈（浅川悠 配音）强行拉入一个神秘组织Night Raid。Night Raid是一支令帝都所有权贵富贾闻风丧胆的暗杀集团，他们是革命军下辖的秘密特殊部队，其最终目标是颠覆大臣的统治。在娜杰塔（水野理纱 配音）的领导下，赤瞳（雨宫天 配音）、雷欧奈等绝世高手云集其下。塔兹米的命运由此发生转折，而接二连三更大的纷争则将其引向未知的彼方……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-05-30 16:59:05","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Xe032YNd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/BeXV7LVb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/rb2JgxAb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/9b6VmXNb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Yer7E8La/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/nel6vx1b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/QeZXwYgb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/lejJvZ4e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/mepVR8yb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/5eVZ5Aoe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/penJYxpe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Rb4KkQJa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/yb8Yo1rd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/QeZXwVgb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Rb4KkRJa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/penJYrpe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":"htt